  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">S</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">marter&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">F</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">armers</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Smarter Farmers（更聪明的农民）是一个非常简单的模组，旨在让农民变得更聪明一些。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以将此模组与其他修改农民行为的模组一起安装，本模组的逻辑将始终拥有最高优先级。</p>\n<p><strong>记得开启生物给予掉落物（Mob Griefing）。否则农民将无法执行任何操作！</strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">农民现在可以：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">与模组添加的作物进行交互、种植和补种</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">根据一定逻辑重新种植作物。他们不再随机选择手中的第一个种子，而是尝试重新种植刚刚收获的作物</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果没有正在补种的作物，农民会根据周围的作物选择一种新作物进行种植。你的麦田里不会再出现孤零零的一片胡萝卜了！</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">接受并拾取来自上述作物的种子，并阻止非农民拾取</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在执行收割任务时会装备锄头。锄头的等级取决于村民的职业等级</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在种植时会装备将要种植的种子。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不再践踏耕地</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以以棋盘格模式种植南瓜和西瓜。它们足够聪明，不会用其他作物的空气方块遮挡现有的南瓜作物。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以在非原版耕地方块（如通过 \"farmer_plantable_on\" 标签调整的方块）上种植和补种。默认包括像 Supplementaries 中的种植箱等方块</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以收割特殊的非作物类方块（通过 \"crop_replaceable\" 标签调整）。默认包括 Immersive Weathering 的杂草以及 Overweight Farming 和 Hefty Crops 的大型作物方块等</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">对甜浆果丛的伤害免疫</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任务失败率大幅降低，整体感觉更加灵敏<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，所有村民现在都会接受并食用你扔给它们的任何（模组添加的）食物并进行繁殖<br><br>还内置了<strong>调试渲染器（Debug Renderers）</strong>，你可以在配置文件中启用它以查看农民的具体思维过程。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组花费了我大量时间，如果你喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以通过以下方式支持。如果你这样做了，你将收到专属于你的定制<strong>地球仪</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用此优惠。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器吗？去看看 Akliz，他们提供专为模组版 Minecraft 打造的高端品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有非常温馨的社区和出色的支持服务，服务器体验极佳</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享受<strong>8折优惠</strong>，同时也支持了我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
